        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Mose atile, “Mukalebaka umweshi wa Abibu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:1:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abibu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu myeshi ya Bayuda wali pakati ka Kutumpu na Shinde.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " no kusefya Ipasaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ipasaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lishiwi lya Cihibulu ilyalola mukutila “ukucilila,” moneni Ukufuma 12:13 kabili moneni mu mashiwi ya mu Baibele ku mpela.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " lyakwa Yawe Lesa wenu, inshikunkulu ya Cakucilila, pantu Abibu e mweshi amufumishemo mu calo ca Egupto pa nshita ya bushiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaleleka ilambo nge Pasaka kuli Yawe Lesa wenu ilya nama ukufuma pa mpaanga nangu imbushi shenu pa ncende iyo Yawe akasala nge cifulo ce shina lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikalalya iyo nama kumo ne mikate iyatutumuka, lelo mukalelya imikate iyishatutumuka pa nshiku cine lubali, e mikate ya mu bucushi, pantu mwafumine mu lubilo mu calo ca Egupto, epakuti inshiku shonse isha bumi bwenu mukaleibukisha inshita mwafumine mu Egupto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshiku cine lubali mwikalasangwa intutumushi mu calo cenu conse. Mwikalaleka inama mwalekela ilambo pa bushiku bwakubalilapo icungulo ishaleko mpaka ulucelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwikalalekela ilambo lye Pasaka mu musumba uuli onse Yawe Lesa wenu alemupeela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanofye pa ncende iyo Yawe Lesa wenu akasala nge cifulo ce shina lyakwe. Epantu mukalalekela ilambo lye Pasaka mu cungulo, ilyo akasuba kawa, pakwibukisha inshita ilya ine mwafuminepo mu Egupto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli nokoca inama no kuilya pa ncende ine Yawe Lesa wenu akasala. Elyo akacelo mwabwelelamo ku matenti yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshiku mutanda mukalelya imikate iyishatutumuka, nomba pa bushiku bwalenga cine lubali mukalelongana pamo pakucindika Yawe Lesa wenu, kabili mwikalabombapo imilimo iyoo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
