            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.26+NUM.28.27+NUM.28.28+NUM.28.29+NUM.28.30+NUM.28.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 28:26-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukalependa imilungu cine lubali ukufuma ubushiku mwatampa ukulobolola iŋanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mukalesefya inshikunkulu ya milungu, iyakucindikilamo Yawe Lesa wenu, pakumuletela umutuulo wakuitemenwafye ukulingana ne paalo ilyo amupaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili mukalesansamuka pa cinso cakwa Yawe Lesa wenu, pa ncende iyo Yawe Lesa wenu akasala nge cifulo ce shina lyakwe. Mukalesansamukila pamo imwe, abana benu abaume na banakashi, ababomfi benu abaume na banakashi, na bena Levi abaikala mu misumba yenu, kabili na benafyalo, bakashiwa, na bamukamfwilwa abo mwikala nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleibukisha ukuti mwali abasha mu calo ca Egupto, kanshi mulekonka bwino aya mafunde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
