                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mulesefya inshikunkulu ya Nsakwe pa nshiku cine lubali ilyo mwapwisha ukututila iŋanu, elyo no kukama ifitwalo fya myangashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukalesansamuka mu nshikunkulu shenu, imwe, abana benu abaume na banakashi, ababomfi benu abaume na banakashi, abena Levi, abenafyalo, bakashiwa na bamukamfwilwa abekala mu misumba yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshiku cine lubali mukalesefya inshikunkulu mukucindika Yawe Lesa wenu, pa ncende iyo Yawe akasala. Pantu Yawe Lesa wenu akamupaala mu busomboshi bwenu ne milimo ya maboko yenu, elyo ne nsansa shenu shikaba ishapwililika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
